  "description": "Summary of Proposed Works\r\rThe proposed works comprise the refurbishment of the existing bathroom and separate shower/WC within a flat in Cromwell Tower, including replacement sanitary ware, finishes, and fittings, together with the installation of new full-height internal doors to both rooms.\r\rThe existing Barbican doors incorporate a smaller fixed panel above. The proposed new doors will extend to full height, removing the upper fixed panel while retaining the plain, flush character of the original joinery. The existing architrave proportions and characteristic shadow gap detailing will be retained and matched.\r\rOnly the installation of the new full-height doors requires Listed Building Consent. The remaining works relate to the like-for-like refurbishment of the bathroom and shower/WC.\r\rAll works are non-structural, confined entirely to the interior of the flat, and will be carried out in a manner that respects the character and detailing of the original Barbican interiors.",
